# ouisi.co — redirects for Cloudflare Pages, launch 1 (the door).
# Not active in a local build. Nothing here touches go.ouisi.co or a QR code (SITEMAP-NEW, launch order).
#
# Printed paths and the two the runbook names. /original is a store-wide Shopify redirect today
# (WEB-MIGRATION-RUNBOOK, "the trap") — sending it to the shop keeps the guidebook's URL alive.
/original            https://shop.ouisi.co/products/connecting-photo-cards            301   # Paul, 11-04: straight to the product page, not via the shop's own /original redirect
/blog                https://shop.ouisi.co/blogs/how-we-see-a-blog-on-connection      301
/app                 /apps/                                                           301
# The app policies moved to one pattern the day after launch (Paul, 11-02: "Why would these be different formats?").
/apps/privacy        /apps/photologue/privacy/                                        301
/apps/terms          /apps/photologue/terms/                                          301
/apps/daily-privacy  /apps/daily/privacy/                                             301
/apps/daily-terms    /apps/daily/terms/                                               301
# Each app's own address lands on its section of /apps until there are app pages of their own.
/apps/daily          /apps/#daily                                                     302
/apps/photologue     /apps/#photologue                                                302
#
# The portal stays on go.ouisi.co until launch 2 — temporary redirects on purpose.
/nature              https://shop.ouisi.co/products/ouisi-nature-set                  301   # Paul, 11-02: the product page, like /original
# /learn is a page of its own from 11-04 (Paul: "Start building").
#
# Shopify-era paths: ouisi.co is a connected domain that redirects to shop.ouisi.co today, path kept
# (that is how ouisi.co/original works). These keep old links landing where they land now.
/products/*          https://shop.ouisi.co/products/:splat                            301
/collections/*       https://shop.ouisi.co/collections/:splat                         301
/pages/*             https://shop.ouisi.co/pages/:splat                               301
/policies/*          https://shop.ouisi.co/policies/:splat                            301
/blogs/*             https://shop.ouisi.co/blogs/:splat                               301
/apps/help-center    https://shop.ouisi.co/apps/help-center                           301
/apps/enzuzo/*       https://shop.ouisi.co/apps/enzuzo/:splat                         301
/cart                https://shop.ouisi.co/cart                                       301
/account             https://shop.ouisi.co/account                                    301
/account/*           https://shop.ouisi.co/account/:splat                             301
/search              https://shop.ouisi.co/search                                     301
#
# The store's own URL Redirects (Shopify admin → Content → Menus → URL redirects) are deliberately NOT carried
# here: Paul, 11-03, "i want to clean up this list, not use them".
